# 2-D SOURCE PANEL METHOD WITH EXPERIMENTAL COMPARISON
# =========================================================================
# This MATLAB code implements the 2-D source panel method with:
# 1. Robust error handling for user inputs and file operations
# 2. Comparison with experimental data and analytical results
# 3. Interactive prompts for flow conditions
# 4. Comprehensive validation and visualization
#
# File format for airfoil coordinates:
#   x1 y1
#   x2 y2
#   ...
#   xn yn
#
