        # VISTA 2023 PROCEDURAL TERRAIN OPTIMIZATION GUIDE

        ## 1. PERFORMANCE BOTTLENECKS & SOLUTIONS

        ### 1.1 Heightmap Generation Bottleneck
        **Challenge**: Vista 2023 heightmap generation can be CPU-intensive, especially
